            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuno kwe kwolesebwa Katonda kwe yalaga Nakkumu, Omwerukoosi okukwata ku bibambulira ebyali bijjira Nineeve.",
